  "description": "Arkcon welcomes you to our one bed flat to let on the ever popular Cabra Park, Dublin 7. Please email your enquiry. Phone call enquiries are not accepted due to high volume demand. We aim to respond to all enquiries, however this may not be possible. Thank you for your understanding.\n\nLetting experts Arkcon are thrilled to present this beautifully finished, one bed flat, ideally situated on Cabra Park, Dublin 7. This is a rare opportunity to be the first occupant of a thoughtfully designed and high quality home, finished to an exceptional standard throughout. Upon entry to the apartment, you are welcomed to a bright and modern space, presented to an immaculate standard throughout. The kitchen has been fitted with brand new modern appliances, including a four ring hob, oven, grill and more, with ample worktop and storage space. Facing the kitchen is a table and chairs for dining and living purposes. There is a comfortable double bed and adequate storage space throughout. The bathroom is gleaming and benefits from an electric shower providing instant hot water. There is electric heating throughout. A communal laundry facility is conveniently located in the hallway, available to all residents. Permit parking is available in the surrounding area. High speed Wi-Fi and bin collection are included in the monthly rent.\n\nCabra Park is a well-regarded and quietly situated residential address in the heart of Cabra, one of Dublin 7's most established and community-focused neighbourhoods. The area is well served by a wide range of local amenities, with supermarkets, cafés, shops and everyday services all within easy reach. The extensive grounds of the Phoenix Park — one of the largest enclosed recreational spaces in any European capital — are readily accessible, offering hundreds of acres of parkland, walking routes and green space on the doorstep. Phibsborough, with its vibrant village atmosphere and growing selection of restaurants, cafés and bars, is within comfortable walking distance. The area is well connected by public transport, with numerous bus routes serving the surrounding streets and providing frequent access to Dublin city centre and beyond.\n\nPlease email your enquiry to make this property your own. References and documents are required by all applicants. Available immediately. WiFi and bin collection are included in the monthly rent. All other bills are not included.",
